    "type": "game",
    "name": "Resprite",
    "steam_appid": 3146020,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resprite is a pixel art editor. You can use it to create game assets and animations. If you have used image editing software such as GIMP, PhotoShop, iDraw3, Aseprite, Pixelorama, etc., you can easily get started. In addition to the regular editing functions, Resprite has the following features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >1. Flexible user interface</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust the interface layout to your suitable position</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Floating window</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize theme colors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >2.\u00a0Rich timeline functions</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can focus on a certain animation clip. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can set properties such as blending mode for layer groups. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can set layers as clipping masks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3. Free-position color palette</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely arrange color positions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Color interpolation</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4\uff0cMore Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive curve tool</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embedded reference images in documents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Export bead pattern</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Export video</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the desktop version released on Steam, Resprite is also available on iOS and Android platforms.\u00a0Come join our community to share your art, feedback, and feature suggestions.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resprite is a pixel art editor. You can use it to create game assets and animations. If you have used image editing software such as GIMP, PhotoShop, iDraw3, Aseprite, Pixelorama, etc., you can easily get started. In addition to the regular editing functions, Resprite has the following features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >1. Flexible user interface</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust the interface layout to your suitable position</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Floating window</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize theme colors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >2.\u00a0Rich timeline functions</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can focus on a certain animation clip. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can set properties such as blending mode for layer groups. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can set layers as clipping masks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3. Free-position color palette</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely arrange color positions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Color interpolation</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4\uff0cMore Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive curve tool</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embedded reference images in documents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Export bead pattern</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Export video</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the desktop version released on Steam, Resprite is also available on iOS and Android platforms.\u00a0Come join our community to share your art, feedback, and feature suggestions.</p>",
    "short_description": "Resprite is a pixel art editor. You can use it to create pixel art, sprite animations, and art assets for pixel games. It supports new features such as flexible interface layout and clipping masks.",
